  "question": {
    "text": "A plano-convex lens has diameter&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>&nbsp;and its thickness at the centre is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>. If the speed of light inside the lens is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>ms</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, then what is&nbsp;the focal length (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cm</mi></math>) of the lens?"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "25.25",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/abs/f9f52475-fbbc-4784-a749-dc2934bf6889-57.JPG\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 167px;\" /></p><p>R. I. of lens,</p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mi>v</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><p>From <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;ACO</mi><mo>,</mo></math> radius of curvature of lens is,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></math><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0625</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math></p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3125</mn></math><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>625</mn><mi>cm</mi></math></p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>625</mn></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>"
  }
